[{"id": "R025", "text": "The person removes the peeling label from the drawer, replaces it, rubs the marked groove once, and moves to the next job. If the corner still catches, they leave it alone and mark the next one."}, {"id": "R026", "text": "The person presses the peeling edge with a thumbnail, examines where the paper caught, leaves the corner alone, and turns the clock once."}, {"id": "R027", "text": "The person stops, checks the watch, peels the label, and repeatedly checks the dust, watch, and tinkered piece. They keep the area tidy, ask the watch for the date, check the corner, and mark it."}, {"id": "R028", "text": "The person touches the peeling edge once with a thumbnail, stops, and leaves the label on the corner. They place the peeled piece on the bench, leave the corner where it fell, continue the work, and keep the label beside the bench."}, {"id": "R029", "text": "The person rubs the peeling label with a thumb, moves it closer, and puts it in a pocket. They remove a rusted bolt from the corner, test its edge, and leave it there if it works."}, {"id": "R030", "text": "The person presses the label against the corner, taps the page edge twice, says one number, and writes another beside it. They set the peeling corner aside, tap the page edge twice again, and write a third number next to the label."}, {"id": "R031", "text": "The person taps the label, peels it, and leaves the job."}, {"id": "R032", "text": "The person keeps the label beside the corner and taps the peeling edge with a knuckle. If it stays attached, they mark the spot with a pencil line instead of peeling it."}, {"id": "R033", "text": "The person marks the peeling label with a pencil and turns it by hand. They leave the corner alone for a minute, repeat that wait if the label still peels, and mark it again."}, {"id": "R034", "text": "The person places a seed tin beside the peeling label, observes the peeling begin, and returns the tin to its place. They look at the label, state that the seed stays, and wait for the peeling to stop."}, {"id": "R035", "text": "The person peels the label back, returns it to the wall, and repeats this after a small line appears. They leave the corner open, then move the wall so the line is no longer visible."}, {"id": "R036", "text": "The person scrapes the peeling edge with a thumbnail, states that they will mark it, puts the label down, and scrapes again while inspecting the cracked edge. They repeatedly state that they are marking it and alternate between scraping and marking."}]
